UID:129795294@www.shadysideacademy.org
DTSTAMP:20260901T003652Z
DTSTART:20260929T173000
DTEND:20260929T190000
SUMMARY:Blue & Gold Parent Ambassador Information Session
DESCRIPTION:Curious about volunteering but don't have a lot of time? SSA's Alumni & Development team hosts a special Academy-wide Blue & Gold Parent Ambassador volunteer program that meets four times a year and makes a tremendous difference for the school! Join our Information Session on September 29th to learn more about the program's goals and opportunities. Dinner served at 5:30pm and the program begins at 6:00pm. To register or ask questions\, please RSVP to Director of Annual Giving\, Katie Modic by emailing kmodic@shadysideacademy.org.
LOCATION:Upper School Campus - SS Memorial Library
PRIORITY:0
